# Cloudflare Pages serves these routes as deployment assets, but its default
# response asks browsers and shared caches to revalidate every request. Keep
# browser revalidation while allowing the CDN to reuse public SEO pages for one
# day. Dynamic Functions, checkout, API, and private app routes are absent.

